0..70 Comment "// Atom sorts (Pitts, _Nominal Sets_, CUP 2013; Gabbay and Mathijssen,"
71..143 Comment "// _Nominal (universal) algebra_, JLC 2009). A sort classified `Atom` is"
144..222 Comment "// orbit-infinite, with equality and swapping its only structure: an operation"
223..301 Comment "// takes an atom, and none returns one. Each block is a value of `Theory` that"
302..380 Comment "// keeps the atom sort as an `Atom` link of its sort chain, so a program reads"
381..402 Comment "// it back by `case`."
404..439 Comment "/// One atom sort and nothing else."
